==Description==
'''v1.81.0''' is the one hundred and thirty-third update to be released in Tower Defense Simulator, on the 26th of November 2025. It added the Black Friday 2025 Sale.

This update encompassed eight versions, the main v1.81.0 update (released 26 November 2025) and seven minor updates, the v1.81.1 (released 26 November 2025), v1.81.1a (released 26 November 2025) v1.81.1b (released 26 November 2025), v1.81.2 (released 27 November 2025), v1.81.3 (released 27 November 2025), v1.81.4 (released 29 November 2025) and v1.81.4a (1 December 2025).

==Additions==
*Merch Shop
*{{Color|Medium}} Difficulty

==Changes & Bugfixes==
*[[Winter Abyss]] remade.
*[[Midnight Issue]] can now be overridden in [[Matchmaking]].
*[[Midnight Issue]] difficulty changed from {{Color|Normal}} to {{Color|Medium}}.
*Tower abilities now can have initial cooldowns which start when the tower is placed down.
**[[DJ Booth]]'s ''Drop The Beat'' ability now has an initial cooldown of 10 seconds.
**[[Medic]]'s ''Ubercharge'' ability now has an initial cooldown of 15 seconds.
**[[Mercenary Base]]'s ''Air-Drop'' ability now has an initial cooldown of 15 seconds.
*[[NullAndVoid Nametag]] now scales properly.
*Extended the [[Null & Void Event#Null & Void Battle Pass|Null & Void Battle Pass]] to the 1st of December 2025.
